            "review_title": "Review at Lẩu Bò Giáo Toàn",
            "review_text": "Astor H\nNorway14 contributions\n0\nGreat food and good vibes\nJul 2026 • Friends\nMe and my friends visited this restaurant two times during our stay in Ho Chi Minh. First time we tried the beef and noodle soup, the second time we ate the hotpot. Both times we were happy and satisfied with both the food and the experience. \nWill visit again next time I’m in Ho Chi Minh.\nWorth noticing that the restaurant is pretty warm, so wear clothing fit for the occasion.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten July 17, 2026",
